		{
			dependencies: ["48734150D1E23719"]
			description: [
				"The Polaroid addon provides an instant-camera branch of Exposure. It is ideal for group portraits, construction milestones and quick field labels."
				"Instant does not mean disposable. Name or display important images and keep the archive copy away from creepers, lava and boss arenas."
				"Use ordinary Exposure film for planned expedition stories and instant photos for moments that would disappear while the darkroom is prepared."
				"Exposure albums tell stories in sequence. Name each volume, separate master photographs from travelling copies, and add written context when the image alone cannot explain location or danger."
			]
