		{
			dependencies: ["6A9FA5C21DC2E03D"]
			description: [
				"Immersive Paintings expands the ways images and art appear in builds. Use it for maps, signs, portraits and exhibits that serve the room's purpose."
				"Test scale and placement in a private workshop before covering a public wall. Very large or numerous custom images can create visual clutter and extra client work."
				"Credit the builder or photographer where appropriate. A shared gallery works when art remains connected to the people and places it records."
				"Photography records both beauty and procedure. Capture portals, machine layouts, dungeon entrances, crop tests, and rare creatures as well as scenic views so the archive becomes a practical manual."
			]
