		{
			dependencies: ["6A9FA5C21DC2E03D"]
			description: [
				"Display Case, Statues, Fetzi's Displays, item frames, labels and fish plaques let you show armour, small artifacts, models, blocks and catches in different ways."
				"Choose the display that makes the object readable without obstructing paths. Test moving or animated displays away from redstone and Create contraptions."
				"Label the mod, location and story rather than only the item name. JEI can identify an object; the museum should explain why this particular one was kept."
				"Display cases, fish displays, labels, paintings, and statues communicate best when each object has provenance. Include mod, location, finder, date, and whether the item is safe to borrow."
			]
