		{
			dependencies: ["09E5D00696C515A7"]
			description: [
				"Immersive Melodies adds playable instruments for solo and group performance. Learn rhythm and range with one instrument before assembling the entire orchestra."
				"Choose a rehearsal place away from bedrooms, trading halls and precision voice-chat moments. Agree when performances are welcome."
				"Use music for departures, boss victories and festivals. A repeated tune can become part of the server's identity just like a flag or road style."
				"Immersive Melodies makes music collaborative. Keep spare instruments in a public venue, practise controls, and use performances as server rituals rather than another set of objects hidden in storage."
			]
